      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹7.20 (up from ₹0.33 loss in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹158.3m (up ₹149.6m from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹100.1m (up ₹104.7m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 63% (up from net loss in 3Q 2025). The move to profitability was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 95% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 88% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
